---
import { site } from '../config/site';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
const copyrightYears =
  site.startYear < currentYear ? `${site.startYear}–${currentYear}` : `${currentYear}`;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container site-footer__inner">
    <p>© {copyrightYears} {site.name} · Some Rights Reserved</p>
    <div class="site-footer__links">
      {
        site.github ? (
          <a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            GitHub<span class="visually-hidden">（在新窗口打开）</span>
          </a>
        ) : null
      }
      <a href="/blog/">笔记</a>
      <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="site-footer__notice">
      站点内容均来自于公开网络或博主自行创建，在未获得创作者本人同意时禁止以任意形式转载、分发。
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
